  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to UNSG&apos;s Climate Action Team (2023-2026)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Secretary-General&apos;s Climate Action Priorities with the overarching aim of narrowing the global emissions gap to keep the 1.5 C goal alive and to secure a quantum leap on climate justice (which refers to, inter alia, scaling-up climate finance, investment in adaptation, delivery of  early warning systems, and addressing of loss and damage) that addresses the specific needs of ODA-eligible vulnerable developing countries, is succesful.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the Climate Action Team priorities of the Secretary-General of the United Nations, specially targeting ODA - eligible countries.</narrative>
  </description>
